hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1589","Abdul-Jabbar bin Al-Ala told us, Sufyan told us, he said: I heard Al-Zuhri, saying: Muhammad bin Jubayr bin Mut’im told me, on the authority of his father. H Ali bin Khashram told us, Ibn Uyaynah told us, Saeed bin Abdul Rahman Al Makhzoumi told us, Sufyan told us, on the authority of Al-Zuhri, on the authority of Muhammad bin Jubayr bin Mutim, on the authority of his father, said: I heard the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, “reciting the Qur’an in the Maghrib prayer.”"
